  "calculation": {
    "expression": "rank_cs(rolling_sum_20(residual_log_return) * regime_multiplier) - 0.5, lagged 1 day",
    "description": "Compute each asset's daily log return minus the cross-sectional mean, sum residual returns over 20 sessions, and multiply by 1 in normal VIX regimes or -0.5 when lagged VIX is more than one standard deviation above its 120-session mean. Cross-sectionally rank the result and lag one session to prevent look-ahead."
